        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Dong-wook, Kim Dae-seung\n- Works: Happy Killers, Romantic Heaven, The Concubine\n- Topics: South Korean historical films, acting career reception\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Dong-wook starred in the film \"Happy Killers\" in 2010.\n- Kim Dong-wook starred in the film \"Romantic Heaven\" in 2011.\n- In 2012, Kim Dong-wook received the best reviews of his career for playing an obsessed and tormented king in the period drama film \"The Concubine.\"\n- \"The Concubine\" is a 2012 South Korean historical film directed by Kim Dae-seung.",
